> **Source** <a href="https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v6.19/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_gem_shmem_helper.c#L653-L691" target="_blank">drivers/gpu/drm/drm_gem_shmem_helper.c L653-L691</a> (Linux v6.19)

When userspace first reads or writes to the mapped address, a <b>page fault</b> occurs, and the object's fault handler maps the backing pages into the page table entries one by one.  

